  "prefLabel": "He-E 503.01 Purpose",
  "priorExpiration": "2019-11-18",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-E 503.01 Purpose. The purpose of the respite care described in this rule is to provide temporary rest and relief to the primary caregiver from the demands of care provided to a person with Alzheimer’s disease or a related disorder at home.\n\nSource. #5584, eff 2-16-93; ss by #5732, eff 10-27-93, EXPIRED: 10-27-99\n\nNew. #7799, eff 12-4-02, EXPIRED: 12-4-10\n\nNew. #9834, INTERIM, eff 12-18-10, EXPIRES: 6-16-11; ss by #9931, eff 5-26-11; ss by #12781, INTERIM, eff 5-21-19, EXPIRED: 11-18-19\n\nNew. #13437, eff 8-19-22",
